son/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Add `mori capabilities --json` so editors and developers can distinguish this Rust binary’s source profiles, compiled features, compiler artifact versions and target qualification before choosing a consumer. The query reports the current source catalogue without probing targets or running the listed consumers.\n\nValidation at `ff4f718d8b1d9deccf40ff7597b6afbb1f1ccf75`: source-only CLI integration tests 2 passed (53.793s including cold build); ordinary opt-in feature query test 1 passed (5.596s). Two direct actual CLI outputs match the complete specified JSON contracts. Tests use returned profile headers through real Core/1 and Core/2 source-only check/inspect consumers. Source pins stayed unchanged and temporary outputs were removed.\n\nThe catalogue inspection basis is the actual base main revision, not a claimed binary identity. LSP and MCP are correctly reported as stubs at that source; merging their implementations requires updating the catalogue and tests. Build availability does not establish compiler, proof or ledger qualification. This draft awaits fresh independent exact-source/result review. Earlier source-only candidate DTO mistakes are preserved in delivery evidence and corrected here.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-18T12:25:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T13:15:43Z","closed_at":"2026-10-18T13:15:43Z","merged_at":"2026-10-18T13:15:43Z","merge_commit_sha":"b2786e8123e8d9327265f0fbb373444a7cb30f16","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CharlesHoskinson:doctorwatson-language/public-capabilities-20261018","ref":"doctorwatson-language/public-capabilities-20261018","repo":{"id":1360485122,"node_id":"R_kgDOURdbAg","name":"Moriarty","full_name":"CharlesHoskinson/Moriarty","owner":{"login":"CharlesHoskinson","id":3279952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzk5NTI=","avatar_url":"https: